# Raw dataset images are third-party medical data. Currently: AZH Wound and Vascular Center
# dataset (github.com/uwm-bigdata/wound-classification-using-images-and-locations; venous,
# diabetic, pressure, surgical). Not committed simply to keep the repo small/fast to clone --
# run scripts/fetch_azh_dataset.py to repopulate data/raw/ from the public, checksum-verified
# source. See dataset_report.md and paper/methodology/dataset_selection.md for why this
# replaced the earlier Mendeley normal/wound dataset (archived below, not deleted).
data/raw/
data/_download/
data/_download_azh/
data/raw_dfu_archive/
data/raw_mendeley_archive/

# Local virtualenv
.venv/

# Trained model weights / large artifacts (regenerable by running the pipeline)
results/classical_backbone_state.pt
results/classical_features.npy
results_effnet/classical_backbone_state.pt
results_effnet/classical_features.npy

__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Raw stdout/stderr logs from manual training runs
*.log
